{"id":"2026-11-12-code-engineers-found-a-real","date":"2026-11-12","topic":"code","region":"americas","headline":"Engineers Found a Real Insect Inside an Early Computer","source":{"name":"Wikipedia","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Grace_Hopper"},"accent":"uk","tiers":{"t1":{"sentences":[{"text":"Grace Hopper worked on a big computer in 1947.","voice":"voice/2026-11-12-code-engineers-found-a-real/t1-0.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":4.83,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-12-code-engineers-found-a-real/ja/t1-0.m4a","durJa":6.13,"times":[0.0,0.28,0.86,1.28,1.7,1.82,2.04,2.8,3.28]},{"text":"The large computer stopped working one day.","voice":"voice/2026-11-12-code-engineers-found-a-real/t1-1.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","V","O","M","M"],"dur":2.85,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-12-code-engineers-found-a-real/ja/t1-1.m4a","durJa":4.3,"times":[0.0,0.1,0.32,0.8,1.44,2.06,2.38]},{"text":"Her team looked inside the machine very carefully.","voice":"voice/2026-11-12-code-engineers-found-a-real/t1-2.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":3.25,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-12-code-engineers-found-a-real/ja/t1-2.m4a","durJa":4.42,"times":[0.0,0.1,0.38,0.78,1.26,1.62,1.9,2.4]},{"text":"They found a small dead bug inside a switch.","voice":"voice/2026-11-12-code-engineers-found-a-real/t1-3.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","O","O","M","M","M"],"dur":3.55,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-12-code-engineers-found-a-real/ja/t1-3.m4a","durJa":4.19,"times":[0.0,0.1,0.38,0.68,1.06,1.46,1.86,2.52,2.86]},{"text":"They taped the insect into their main record book.","voice":"voice/2026-11-12-code-engineers-found-a-real/t1-4.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":3.54,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-12-code-engineers-found-a-real/ja/t1-4.m4a","durJa":5.04,"times":[0.0,0.08,0.42,0.74,1.18,1.58,1.88,2.12,2.6]}],"bands":{"core1000":86,"core1800":8,"ngsl":0,"tsl":2,"nawl":2,"beyond":2},"grammar":[{"i":0,"focus":"in 1947.","title":"Prepositional Phrase for Time","note":"We use 'in' before specific years to state when something happened. Here, it tells us the year Grace Hopper did her work."},{"i":1,"focus":"stopped working","title":"Gerund as Object","note":"The verb 'stop' can take a gerund (-ing verb form) as its direct object. It means to end an ongoing activity or function."}]},"t2":{"sentences":[{"text":"In 1947, Grace Hopper worked on the Harvard Mark II computer.","voice":"voice/2026-11-12-code-engineers-found-a-real/t2-0.m4a","roles":["M","M","S","S","V","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":5.49,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-12-code-engineers-found-a-real/ja/t2-0.m4a","durJa":6.81,"times":[0.0,0.22,1.96,2.22,2.68,3.1,3.38,3.5,3.84,4.2,4.68]},{"text":"The machine stopped working because a moth got stuck inside it.","voice":"voice/2026-11-12-code-engineers-found-a-real/t2-1.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","O","M","S","S","V","C","M","M"],"dur":3.92,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-12-code-engineers-found-a-real/ja/t2-1.m4a","durJa":4.13,"times":[0.0,0.06,0.28,0.7,1.26,1.7,1.92,2.22,2.6,2.94,3.38]},{"text":"Engineers found the dead insect inside an electrical switch.","voice":"voice/2026-11-12-code-engineers-found-a-real/t2-2.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","O","M","M","M","M"],"dur":3.84,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-12-code-engineers-found-a-real/ja/t2-2.m4a","durJa":4.54,"times":[0.0,0.34,0.78,1.08,1.3,1.78,2.36,2.74,3.12]},{"text":"They removed the insect carefully and taped it into their logbook.","voice":"voice/2026-11-12-code-engineers-found-a-real/t2-3.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","M","M","V","O","M","M","M"],"dur":3.65,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-12-code-engineers-found-a-real/ja/t2-3.m4a","durJa":6.03,"times":[0.0,0.1,0.36,0.66,1.0,1.56,2.04,2.26,2.52,2.8,3.0]},{"text":"The team wrote that this was the first real computer bug.","voice":"voice/2026-11-12-code-engineers-found-a-real/t2-4.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","M","S","V","C","C","C","C","C"],"dur":3.48,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-12-code-engineers-found-a-real/ja/t2-4.m4a","durJa":4.99,"times":[0.0,0.08,0.28,0.58,0.9,1.08,1.3,1.44,1.7,2.2,2.82]},{"text":"Future programmers will always remember Hopper for her great software work.","voice":"voice/2026-11-12-code-engineers-found-a-real/t2-5.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","M","V","O","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":4.55,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-12-code-engineers-found-a-real/ja/t2-5.m4a","durJa":6.49,"times":[0.0,0.28,0.64,1.04,1.36,1.84,2.34,2.64,2.78,3.06,3.48]}],"bands":{"core1000":75,"core1800":12,"ngsl":0,"tsl":5,"nawl":4,"beyond":4},"grammar":[{"i":1,"focus":"because a moth got stuck inside it.","title":"Adverbial Clause of Reason","note":"The word 'because' starts a subordinate clause explaining the reason behind the main clause. It connects cause directly to effect."},{"i":5,"focus":"will always remember","title":"Adverb Placement with Modals","note":"Adverbs of frequency like 'always' are placed between the modal auxiliary ('will') and the main verb ('remember')."}]},"t3":{"sentences":[{"text":"In 1947, engineers working on the Harvard Mark II computer encountered an unusual problem.","voice":"voice/2026-11-12-code-engineers-found-a-real/t3-0.m4a","roles":["M","M","S","S","S","S","S","S","S","S","V","O","O","O"],"dur":7.99,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-12-code-engineers-found-a-real/ja/t3-0.m4a","durJa":8.21,"times":[0.0,0.26,1.42,2.48,3.18,3.4,3.52,3.86,4.22,4.68,5.4,6.24,6.62,7.04]},{"text":"A moth entered a relay, which was an electrical switch inside the massive computer.","voice":"voice/2026-11-12-code-engineers-found-a-real/t3-1.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","O","O","S","V","C","C","C","C","C","C","C"],"dur":5.41,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-12-code-engineers-found-a-real/ja/t3-1.m4a","durJa":5.84,"times":[0.0,0.06,0.34,0.9,1.06,1.92,2.1,2.28,2.42,2.74,3.2,3.68,4.24,4.6]},{"text":"The trapped insect stopped the switch from operating properly and halted the machine.","voice":"voice/2026-11-12-code-engineers-found-a-real/t3-2.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","V","O","O","M","M","M","M","V","O","O"],"dur":4.93,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-12-code-engineers-found-a-real/ja/t3-2.m4a","durJa":5.42,"times":[0.0,0.0,0.28,0.78,1.3,1.62,1.84,2.12,2.58,3.14,3.74,4.06,4.46]},{"text":"Computer pioneer Grace Hopper and her team removed the moth from the electrical system.","voice":"voice/2026-11-12-code-engineers-found-a-real/t3-3.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","S","S","S","S","V","O","O","M","M","M","M"],"dur":5.49,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-12-code-engineers-found-a-real/ja/t3-3.m4a","durJa":6.64,"times":[0.0,0.68,0.94,1.58,2.0,2.34,2.52,2.82,3.52,3.92,4.08,4.42,4.54,4.9]},{"text":"They taped the insect into their official logbook along with a short note.","voice":"voice/2026-11-12-code-engineers-found-a-real/t3-4.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":4.35,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-12-code-engineers-found-a-real/ja/t3-4.m4a","durJa":5.96,"times":[0.0,0.1,0.32,0.58,0.82,1.24,1.46,1.82,2.46,3.04,3.4,3.46,3.7]},{"text":"The team wrote that they had found the first actual case of a bug.","voice":"voice/2026-11-12-code-engineers-found-a-real/t3-5.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","M","S","V","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":4.26,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-12-code-engineers-found-a-real/ja/t3-5.m4a","durJa":4.33,"times":[0.0,0.06,0.28,0.54,1.02,1.14,1.28,1.56,1.82,2.2,2.6,3.26,3.7,3.78]},{"text":"Hopper later built a compiler, which is a program translating code into machine instructions.","voice":"voice/2026-11-12-code-engineers-found-a-real/t3-6.m4a","roles":["S","M","V","O","O","S","V","C","C","C","C","C","C","C"],"dur":5.8,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-12-code-engineers-found-a-real/ja/t3-6.m4a","durJa":7.29,"times":[0.0,0.2,0.46,0.8,1.0,2.04,2.12,2.24,2.32,2.66,3.26,3.7,4.16,4.5]}],"bands":{"core1000":70,"core1800":10,"ngsl":6,"tsl":4,"nawl":2,"beyond":8},"grammar":[{"i":0,"focus":"engineers working on the Harvard Mark II computer","title":"Participial Modifier","note":"The present participle phrase 'working...' modifies the noun 'engineers'. It acts like a shortened relative clause ('engineers who were working')."},{"i":1,"focus":"which was an electrical switch inside the massive computer.","title":"Non-Restrictive Relative Clause","note":"The relative clause beginning with 'which' gives extra descriptive details about 'a relay'. It is set off by a comma."}]},"t4":{"sentences":[{"text":"While working on the Harvard Mark II computer in 1947, engineers experienced an unexpected technical failure.","voice":"voice/2026-11-12-code-engineers-found-a-real/t4-0.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","S","V","O","O","O","O"],"dur":8.14,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-12-code-engineers-found-a-real/ja/t4-0.m4a","durJa":10.18,"times":[0.0,0.28,0.66,0.88,1.0,1.32,1.66,2.1,2.72,3.02,4.32,4.96,5.76,6.12,6.72,7.28]},{"text":"Upon investigation, a moth was found trapped inside a relay, an electronic switch within the system.","voice":"voice/2026-11-12-code-engineers-found-a-real/t4-1.m4a","roles":["M","M","S","S","V","V","C","C","C","C","C","C","C","C","C","C"],"dur":6.46,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-12-code-engineers-found-a-real/ja/t4-1.m4a","durJa":7.03,"times":[0.0,0.22,0.88,1.48,1.76,2.14,2.46,2.76,3.36,3.56,4.38,4.5,4.8,5.32,5.72,5.92]},{"text":"The insect had prevented the switch from functioning properly, causing the massive system to stop running.","voice":"voice/2026-11-12-code-engineers-found-a-real/t4-2.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","V","O","O","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":5.37,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-12-code-engineers-found-a-real/ja/t4-2.m4a","durJa":7.16,"times":[0.0,0.04,0.34,0.64,0.96,1.28,1.46,1.76,2.22,3.1,3.32,3.6,3.8,4.36,4.66,4.92]},{"text":"Computer pioneer Grace Hopper and her team carefully extracted the dead moth from the electronic equipment.","voice":"voice/2026-11-12-code-engineers-found-a-real/t4-3.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","S","S","S","S","M","V","O","O","O","M","M","M","M"],"dur":5.97,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-12-code-engineers-found-a-real/ja/t4-3.m4a","durJa":7.25,"times":[0.0,0.36,0.6,1.14,1.6,1.92,2.08,2.32,3.08,3.58,3.98,4.14,4.36,4.68,4.82,5.16]},{"text":"The moth was subsequently taped into the team logbook as a permanent record of the incident.","voice":"voice/2026-11-12-code-engineers-found-a-real/t4-4.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","M","V","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":4.84,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-12-code-engineers-found-a-real/ja/t4-4.m4a","durJa":6.72,"times":[0.0,0.2,0.2,0.46,0.92,1.3,1.7,1.86,2.04,2.56,3.04,3.12,3.44,3.92,4.14,4.26]},{"text":"Beside the insect, the engineers noted that this was the first actual case of a bug being found.","voice":"voice/2026-11-12-code-engineers-found-a-real/t4-5.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","S","S","V","M","S","V","C","C","C","C","C","C","C","C","C"],"dur":5.61,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-12-code-engineers-found-a-real/ja/t4-5.m4a","durJa":7.06,"times":[0.0,0.3,0.42,1.14,1.2,1.42,1.94,2.28,2.46,2.58,2.74,3.06,3.38,4.02,4.26,4.36,4.62,5.02]},{"text":"Hopper later developed the first compiler, a program translating written commands into executable machine code.","voice":"voice/2026-11-12-code-engineers-found-a-real/t4-6.m4a","roles":["S","M","V","O","O","O","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":6.43,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-12-code-engineers-found-a-real/ja/t4-6.m4a","durJa":8.86,"times":[0.0,0.2,0.46,0.82,1.1,1.38,2.5,2.6,2.9,3.48,3.86,4.3,4.76,5.24,5.84]},{"text":"She also helped design COBOL, an early programming language that remains in use today.","voice":"voice/2026-11-12-code-engineers-found-a-real/t4-7.m4a","roles":["S","M","V","V","O","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":5.26,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-12-code-engineers-found-a-real/ja/t4-7.m4a","durJa":6.91,"times":[0.0,0.1,0.26,0.64,1.08,2.0,2.08,2.28,2.72,3.18,3.52,3.76,4.06,4.28]}],"bands":{"core1000":68,"core1800":15,"ngsl":6,"tsl":2,"nawl":2,"beyond":7},"grammar":[{"i":2,"focus":"had prevented","title":"Past Perfect Tense","note":"The past perfect ('had' + past participle) shows an action completed before another past event. The moth prevented operation prior to the system stopping."},{"i":7,"focus":"helped design","title":"Bare Infinitive Object","note":"The verb 'help' can take a bare infinitive ('design') without 'to'. Both 'helped design' and 'helped to design' are natural and correct."}]},"t5":{"sentences":[{"text":"In 1947, operators of the Harvard Mark II computer encountered an unexpected disruption in their automated calculations.","voice":"voice/2026-11-12-code-engineers-found-a-real/t5-0.m4a","roles":["M","M","S","S","S","S","S","S","S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":9.81,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-12-code-engineers-found-a-real/ja/t5-0.m4a","durJa":9.2,"times":[0.0,0.22,1.74,2.34,2.86,2.98,3.34,3.72,4.2,4.88,5.7,6.04,6.72,7.26,7.92,8.06,8.48]},{"text":"A thorough inspection revealed that a moth had become trapped inside a relay, an electromechanical switch vital to the machine.","voice":"voice/2026-11-12-code-engineers-found-a-real/t5-1.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","V","M","S","S","V","V","C","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":8.22,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-12-code-engineers-found-a-real/ja/t5-1.m4a","durJa":8.99,"times":[0.0,0.04,0.3,0.9,1.5,1.94,2.06,2.3,2.74,3.0,3.34,3.96,4.16,5.24,5.28,6.18,6.64,7.22,7.66,7.76]},{"text":"The trapped insect obstructed electrical current, bringing the giant system to a sudden halt until team members located the trouble.","voice":"voice/2026-11-12-code-engineers-found-a-real/t5-2.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","V","O","O","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","S","S","V","O","O"],"dur":8.38,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-12-code-engineers-found-a-real/ja/t5-2.m4a","durJa":8.91,"times":[0.0,0.1,0.34,0.9,1.66,2.16,3.3,3.56,3.82,4.12,4.54,4.98,5.08,5.4,5.88,6.36,6.74,7.12,7.54,7.98]},{"text":"Leading computer scientist Grace Hopper and her colleagues carefully extracted the insect from the internal components of the system.","voice":"voice/2026-11-12-code-engineers-found-a-real/t5-3.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","S","S","S","S","S","M","V","O","O","M","M","M","M","M","M","M